<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Lisa Corridor — Hardware Models</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0f1115; --card:#171a21; --border:#2a2f3a; --text:#e8eaed;
    --muted:#9aa3b2; --accent:#7aa2ff;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); padding:40px 24px;
  }
  header{max-width:920px; margin:0 auto 32px;}
  h1{font-size:28px; margin:0 0 6px;}
  p.sub{color:var(--muted); margin:0;}
  .grid{
    max-width:920px; margin:0 auto; display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:18px;
  }
  .card{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px;
    padding:20px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;
  }
  .card h2{font-size:17px; margin:0; word-break:break-word;}
  .badge{
    display:inline-block; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent); border:1px solid var(--accent); border-radius:999px;
    padding:3px 10px; width:fit-content;
  }
  dl{margin:0; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; gap:4px 10px;}
  dt{font-weight:600; color:var(--text);}
  a.dl{
    margin-top:6px; font-size:13px; color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; padding:8px 12px; text-align:center;
  }
  a.dl:hover{border-color:var(--accent);}
  footer{max-width:920px; margin:32px auto 0; color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; line-height:1.5;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Lisa Corridor — Hardware Models</h1>
    <p class="sub">STEP (.step) CAD files for the corridor wardrobe hardware components.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="badge">STEP AP214</span>
